hadiths[168]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6380","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! Anas aap ka khaadim hai uske liye dua farmaiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (اللهم أكثر ماله ‏‏‏‏ وولده ‏‏‏‏ وبارك له فيما أعطيته) ''aey Allah ! iske maal w aulad mein zyadti kar aur jo kuchh to de usmein barkat ata farmaa.''"
"6381","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! Anas aap ka khaadim hai uske liye dua farmaiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (اللهم أكثر ماله ‏‏‏‏ وولده ‏‏‏‏ وبارك له فيما أعطيته) ''aey Allah ! iske maal w aulad mein zyadti kar aur jo kuchh to de usmein barkat ata farmaa.''"
"6382","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein tamam maamlaat mein istikhaara ki taleem detey they, Quran ki sura ki tarah (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya) jab tum mein se koi shakhs kisi (mabaah) kaam ka irada karey (abhii pakka azm na hua ho) to do rakaat (nafl) padhey iske baad yun dua karey ke aey Allah ! main bhalai mangta hun (istikhaara) teri bhalai se, to ilm wala hai, mujhey ilm nahi aur to tamam posheeda baton ko jaanney wala hai, aey Allah ! agar to janta hai ke ye kaam mere liye behtar hai, mere Deen ke eitibaar se, meri roozi rootii (معاش) aur mere anjam kaar ke eitibaar se, ya dua mein ye alfaz kahey (في عاجل أمري وآجله) to usey mere liye muqaddar kar de aur agar to janta hai ke ye kaam mere liye bura hai mere Deen ke liye, meri zindagi ke liye aur mere anjam kaar ke liye, ya ye alfaz farmaai (في عاجل أمري وآجله) to usey mujh se pher de aur mujhey us se pher de aur mere liye bhalai muqaddar kar de jahan kahin bhi wo ho aur phir mujhey us se mut'ma'in kar de (ye dua kartey waqt) apni zarurat ka bayan kar dena chahiye"
"6383","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pani maanga , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wuzu kya, phir hath utha kar ye dua ki ''aey Allah ! Ubaid abu-Aamir ki maghfirat farmaa.'' maine us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baghal ki safedi dekhi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ''aey Allah ! qiyamat ke din usey apni bahut si insani makhlooq se buland martaba ata farmaaiyo .''"
"6384","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein they jab ham kisi buland jagah par chadhtey to takbeer kehtey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''logo ! apne uper rehem karo, tum kisi behrey ghayab rab ko nahi pukaartey ho tum to us zaat ko pukaartey ho jo bahut zyada sun-ney waalaa, bahut zyada dekhney wala hai.'' phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas tashrif laey. main us waqt zere lab keh raha tha (لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Abdullah-bin-Qais kaho (لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله) kyonke ye jannat ke khazaanon mein se aik khazaana hai'' ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya '' main tumhen aik aisa kalima na bata dun jo jannat ke khazaanon mein se aik khazaana                          ( لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله) hai.''"
"6385","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi jang ya Haj ya Umra se wapas hotey to zameen se har buland cheez par chadhtey waqt teen takbeerein kaha kartey they. phir dua kartey (لا إله إلا الله ، Mina وحده لا شريك له ، Mina له الملك وله الحمد ، Mina وهو على كل شيء قدير . آيبون تائبون عابدون ، Mina لربنا حامدون . صدق الله وعده . ونصر عبده ، Mina وهزم الأحزاب وحده) ''Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi, wo tanha hai uska koi Sharik nahi, uske liye baadshaahii hai aur usi ke liye tamam ta'reefein hain aur wo har cheez par qudrat rakhney wala hai. laut'tey hain ham tauba kartey huey apne rab ki ibadat kartey huey aur hamd bayan kartey huey. Allah ne apna wada sach kar dikhaya , apne bande ki madad ki aur tanha tamam lashkar ko shikast dii.''"
"6386","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) par zardi ka asar dekha to farmaya ye kya hai? kaha ke maine aik aurat se aik guthli ke barabar soney par shadi ki hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah tumhen barkat ata farmaai , walima kar, chahey aik bakri ka hi ho."
"6387","mere walid Shahid huey to unhon-ne saat (7) ya nau (9) ladkiyan chhodi thin (raawii ko tadaad mein shuba tha) phir maine aik aurat se shadi ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Jaabir kya tum ne shadi kar li hai? maine kaha ji haan. farmaya kunwaarii se ya bewa se? maine kaha biyaahii se. farmaya, kisi ladki (kunwaarii) se kyon na ki. tum uske sath kheltey aur wo tumharey sath kheltii ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) tum usey hansaatey (ہنساتے) aur wo tumhen hansaatii . maine arz ki, mere walid (Abdullaah) Shahid huey aur saat (7) ya nau (9) ladkiyan chhodi hain. isliye maine pasand nahi kya ke main unke paas unhi jaisi ladki laaun . chunanche maine aisi aurat se shadi ki jo unki nigrani kar sakey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah tumhen barkat ata farmaai . ibne-Uena aur Muhammad-bin-Musalleima ne Amr se riwayat mein ''Allah tumhen barkat ata farmaai '' ke alfaz nahi kahey ."
"6388","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar koi shakhs apni biwi ke paas aaney ka irada karey to ye dua padhey         (باسم الله , Mina padhi. اللهم جنبنا الشيطان , Mina padhi. وجنب الشيطان ما رزقتنا) ''Allah ke naam se, aey Allah ! hamein shaitan se door rakh aur jo kuchh to hamein ata farmaai usey bhi shaitan se door rakh.''  to agar us sohbat se koi aulad muqaddar mein hogi to shaitan usey kuchh bhi nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakega."
"6389","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aksar ye dua hua karti thi (اللهم ربنا آتنا في الدنيا حسنة ، Mina padhi. وفي الآخرة حسنة ، Mina padhi. وقنا عذاب النار) ''aey Allah ! hamein duniya mein bhalai (حسنة) ata kar aur aakhirat mein bhalai ata kar aur hamein dozakh se bacha .''"
"6390","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein ye kalimaat is tarah sikhatey they jaisey likhnaa sikhatey they ( اللهم إني أعوذ بك من البخل , Mina padhi. وأعوذ بك من الجبن , Mina padhi. وأعوذ بك أن نرد إلى أرذل العمر , Mina padhi. وأعوذ بك من فتنة الدنيا , Mina padhi. وعذاب القبر‏ Mina . Mina ( ''aey Allah ! main teri panah mangta hun kanjoosii se aur teri panah mangta hun duniya ki aazmaish se aur qabr ke azab se."
"6391","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kya gaya aur kaifiyat ye hui ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) samajhney lagey ke falan kaam aap ne kar liya hai halanke wo kaam aap ne nahi kya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne rab se dua ki thi, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen malum hai, Allah ne mujhey wo wo baat bata di hai jo maine us se poochhi thi. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne puchha : ya Rasulullah ! wo khuwab kya hai? farmaya mere paas do mard aaey aur aik mere sar ke paas baith gaya aur doosra paon ke paas . phir aik ne apne doosrey sathi se kaha, in sahib ki bimari kya hai? doosrey ne jawab diya, in par jaadoo hua hai. pahley ne puchha kis ne jaadoo kya hai? jawab diya ke Labid bin A'sam ne. puchha wo jaadoo kis cheez mein hai? jawab diya ke kanghi par khajoor ke khoshe mein. puchha wo hai kahaan? kaha ke doran main aur doran bani zuraiq ka aik kunwaan hai. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us kuwein par tashrif le gaey aur jab Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas dobara wapas aaey to farmaya Allah ki qism ! uska pani mahndii se nichodey huey pani ki tarah tha aur wahan ke khajoor ke darakht shaitan ke sar ki tarah they. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur unhein kuwein ke mutaalliq bataya . maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! phir aap ne usey nikala kyon nahi ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Allah Taala ne shifa de di aur maine ye pasand nahi kya ke logon mein aik buri cheez phailaaun. Esa-bin-Yonus aur Leis ne Hisham se izafa kya ke unse unke walid ne bayan kya aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kya gaya to aap barabar dua kartey rahe aur phir poori hadis ko bayan kya."
"6392","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehzaab ke liye baddua ki (اللهم منزل الكتاب ، Mina سريع الحساب ، Mina اهزم الأحزاب ، Mina اهزمهم وزلزلهم) ''aey Allah ! kitab ke nazil karne waley ! hisab jaldi leney waley ! ehzaab ko (mushrekeen ki jamaton ko, jange-Ehzaab mein) shikast de, unhein shikast dedey aur unhein jhanjod de.''"
"6393","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab isha ki aakhir rakaat main (rukoo' se uthtey huey) ( سمع الله لمن حمده) kehtey they, to duaaey qunoot padhtey they (اللهم أنج Ayash بن أبي ربيعة ، Mina اللهم أنج الوليد بن الوليد ، Mina اللهم أنج سلمة بن هشام ، Mina اللهم أنج المستضعفين من المؤمنين ، Mina اللهم اشدد وطأتك على مضر ، Mina اللهم اجعلها سنين كسني يوسف) ''aey Allah ! Ayash bin abi Rabee ko nijat de, aey Allah ! Waleed bin Waleed ko nijat de, aey Allah ! Salma bin Hisham ko nijat de, aey Allah ! kamzor kamzor mominon ko nijat de, aey Allah ! aey Allah ! qabila muzer par apni pakad ko sakht kar de, aey Allah ! wahan aisa qahat (sukha) paida kar de jaisa Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke zamane mein hua tha.''"
"6394","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik muhim bheji , jis mein Sharik logon ko qir'a (yani Quran Majeed ke qaarii) kaha jata tha. un sab ko Shahid kar diya gaya. maine nahi dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi kisi cheez ka itna gham hua ho jitna aapko unki shahadat ka gham hua tha. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik mahiney tak fajr ki Namaz mein unke liye baddua ki, aap kehtey ke a'siiya ne Allah aur uske rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"6395","yahood Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kartey to kehtey (السام عليك‏) aapko maut aaey. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) unka maqsad samajh gain aur jawab diya ke (عليكم السام واللعنة‏) tumhen maut aaey aur tum par laanat ho. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke thehro Aaisha ! Allah tamam mua'amloo mein narmii ko pasand karta hai. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! kya aap ne nahi suna ye log kya kehtey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum ne nahi suna ke main unhein kis tarah jawab deta hun. main kehta hun (وعليكم) ."
"6396","Khandaq ki jang ke mauqe par ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah unki qabron aur unke gharon ko aag se bhar de. unhon-ne hamein (صلاة الوسطى) (asr ki namaaz) nahi padhney di jab tak ke suraj ghurub ho gaya aur ye Asr ki Namaz thi."
"6397","Tufail-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! qabila dos ne nafarmani aur sarkashi ki hai, aap unke liye baddua kijiye . logon ne samjha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke liye baddua hi karengey lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke ''aey Allah ! qabila dos ko hidayat de aur unhein (mere paas) bhej de.''"
"6398","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua kartey they (رب اغفر لي خطيئتي وجهلي وإسرافي في أمري كله ، Mina وما أنت أعلم به مني ، Mina padhi. اللهم اغفر لي خطاياى وعمدي وجهلي وهزلي ، Mina padhi. وكل ذلك عندي ، Mina اللهم اغفر لي ما قدمت وما أخرت وما أسررت وما أعلنت ، Mina أنت المقدم ، Mina وأنت المؤخر ، Mina وأنت على كل شىء قدير) ''mere rab! meri khata , meri naadaanii aur tamam maamlaat mein mere had se aagey nikelney mein meri maghfirat farma aur wo gunah bhi jinko to mujh se zyada jaanney wala hai. aey Allah ! meri maghfirat kar, meri khataaon mein, mere oouper irada aur bila irada kaamon main aur mere hansi mazaak ke kaamon main aur ye sab meri hi taraf se hain. aey Allah ! meri maghfirat kar un kaamon mein jo main kar chuka hun aur unhein jo karunga aur jinhein maine chhipaayaa aur jinhein maine zahir kya hai, to sabse pehley hai aur to hi sabse baad mein hai aur to har cheez par qudrat rakhney wala hai.'' aur Ubaidullah-bin-Muaz (jo imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ke Shekh hain) ne bayan kya ke ham se mere walid ne bayan kya kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Abu-Ishaq ne, unse abu-Burda bin abi Musa ne aur unse unke walid ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6399","unse Abu-Bakar bin abi Musa aur abu-Burda ne mera khayal hai ke abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ke hawale se ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua kya kartey they (اللهم اغفرلي خطيئتي وجهلي وإسرافي في أمري ، Mina ‏‏‏‏وما أنت أعلم به مني ، Mina ‏‏‏‏اللهم اغفر لي هزلي وجدي وخطاى وعمدي ، Mina ‏‏‏‏وكل ذلك عندي‏) ''aey Allah ! meri maghfirat farma meri khataaon mein, meri naadaanii main aur meri kisi maamle mein zyadti mein, un baton mein jinka to mujh se zyada jaanney wala hai. aey Allah ! meri maghfirat kar mere hansi mazaak aur sanjeedagii main aur mere irade main aur ye sab kuchh meri hi taraf se hain.''"
"6400","abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Juma ke din aik aisi ghadi aati hai jis mein agar koi musalman us haal mein pa ley ke wo khada Namaz padh raha ho to jo bhalai bhi wo maangey ga Allah inayat farmaeyga aur aap ne apne hath se ishara farmaya aur ham ne us se ye samjha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is ghadi ke mukhtasar honey ki taraf ishara kar rahe hain."
"6401","yahood Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha (السام عليك‏) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab diya (وعليكم‏) lekin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha (السام عليكم , Mina ولعنكم الله وغضب عليكم‏) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke thahar , Aaisha ! narm khooi ikhtiyar kar aur sakhti aur bad-kalaamii se hamesha parhez kar. unhon-ne kaha : kya aap ne nahi suna ke Yahudi kya keh rahe they? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne nahi suna ke maine unhein kya jawab diya, maine unki baat unhein par lota di aur meri unke badley mein dua qabool ki gaee aur unki mere barey mein qabool nahi ki gaee."
"6402","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''jab padhney wala Aameen kahey to tum bhi Aameen kaho kyonke us waqt malaaika bhi Aameen kehtey hain aur jiski Aameen malaaika ki Aameen ke sath hoti hai iske pichhley gunah maaf kar diye jatey hain.''"
"6403","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne ye kalima ke Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi, tanha hai uska koi Sharik nahi, usi ke liye baadshaahii hai aur usi ke liye ta'reefein hain aur wo har cheez par qudrat rakhney wala hai.'' din mein sou (100) baar padha usey dus (10) ghulaamon ko aazad karne ka sawab milega aur uske liye sou (100) nekiyaan likh di jaeyngi aur uski sou (100) buraaiyaan mitaa di jaeyngi aur us din wo shaitan ke shar se mehfooz rahega Sham (Syria) tak ke liye aur koi shakhs us din us se behtar kaam karne wala nahi samjha jaeyga, siwa uske jo us se zyada kare.''"
"6404","jisne ye kalima dus martaba padh liya wo aisa hoga jaisey us ne aik arabii ghulam aazad kya. isi sanad se Umar-bin-abi-Zayda ne bayan kya ke ham se  Abdullah-bin-Ubai Al-safar (السفر) ne bayan kya, unse Shabi ne, unse Rabe bin khusaim ne, yahi mazmoon to maine Rabe bin khusaim se puchha ke tum ne kis se ye hadis suni hai? unhon-ne kaha ke Amr-bin-Memoon se. phir main Amr-bin-Memoon ke paas aaya aur unse malum kya ke tum ne ye hadis kis se suni hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ibne-abii-Lailaa se. ( phir main) ibne-abii-Lailaa ke paas aaya aur puchha ke tum ne ye hadis kis se suni hai? unhon-ne kaha ke Abu-Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se, wo ye hadis Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kartey they aur Ibrahim bin-Yoosuf ne bayan kya, unse unke walid Yusuf bin Ishaq ne, unse Abu-Ishaq Sabeei ne, unhon-ne kaha ke mujh se Amr-bin-Memoon ne bayan kya, unse Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-abii-Lailaa ne aur unse Abu-Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis naql ki. aur Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kya ke ham se Wuhaib bin Khalid ne bayan kya, unse Daawood-bin-abii-Hind ne, , unse Aamir Shabi ne, unse Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-abii-Lailaa ne aur unse Abu-Ayub (Raziallahu anhu) ne, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. aur Ismail bin abi Khalid ne bayan kya, unse Shabi ne, unse Rabe ne mouqufan (موقوفاً) unka qaul naql kya aur Aadam-bin-abii-Ayaas ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Abdul-Malik bin Maisra ne bayan kya, kaha maine Hilal bin yasaaf (یساف) se suna, unse Rabe bin khusaim aur Amr-bin-Memoon donon ne aur unse ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur Aamash aur husain donon ne Hilal se bayan kya, unse Rabe bin khusaim ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne, yahi hadis riwayat ki. aur abu-Muhammad Hizrami ne Abu-Ayub (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se marfooan usi hadis ko riwayat kya."
"6405","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne (سبحان الله وبحمده) din mein sou (100) martaba kaha, uske gunah maaf kar diye jatey hain, chahe samandar ki jhaag ke barabar hi kyon na hoon.''"
"6406","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' do kalimey jo zaban par halkey hain taraazu mein bahut bhari aur Rehman ko azeez hain (سبحان الله العظيم ، Mina سبحان الله وبحمده).''"
"6407","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us shakhs ki misal jo apne rab ko yad karta hai aur uski misal jo apne rab ko yad nahi karta zinda aur murda jaisi hai.''"
"6408","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ke kuchh Farishtey aisey hain jo raston mein phirtey rahtey hain aur Allah ki yad karne walon ko talash kartey rahtey hain. phir jahan wo kuchh aisey logon ko pa letey hain ke jo Allah ka zikr kartey hotey hain to aik doosrey ko awaz detey hain ke aao hamara matlab hasil ho gaya. phir wo pahley aasman tak apne paron se un par umandtey rahtey hain. phir khatm par apne rab ki taraf chaley jatey hain. phir unka rab unse poochhta hai. . . . halanke wo apne bandon ke mutaalliq khub janta hai. . . . ke mere bandey kya kehtey they? wo jawab detey hain ke wo teri tasbeeh padhtey they, teri badhaai bayan kartey they, teri hamd kartey they aur teri badaai kartey they. phir Allah Taala poochhta hai kya unhon-ne mujhey dekha hai? kaha ke wo jawab detey hain nahi, Allah ki qism ! unhon-ne tujhey nahi dekha. is par Allah Taala farmata hai, phir unka us waqt kya haal hota jab wo mujhey dekhey huey hotey ? wo jawab detey hain ke agar wo tera deedaar kar letey to teri ibadat aur bhi bahut zyada kartey, teri badaai sabse zyada bayan kartey, teri tasbeeh sabse zyada kartey. phir Allah Taala malum karta hai, phir wo mujh se kya maangtey hain? Farishtey kehtey hain ke wo jannat maangtey hain. bayan kya ke Allah Taala malum karta hai kya unhon-ne jannat dekhi hai? Farishtey jawab detey hain nahi, Allah ki qism aey rab! unhon-ne teri jannat nahi dekhi . bayan kya ke Allah Taala malum karta hai unka us waqt kya aalem hota agar unhon-ne jannat ko dekha hota ? Farishtey jawab detey hain ke agar unhon-ne jannat ko dekha hota to wo us se aur bhi zyada khaahishmand hotey , sabse badh kar uske talabgar hotey . phir Allah Taala poochhta hai ke wo kis cheez se panah maangtey hain? Farishtey jawab detey hain, dozakh se. Allah Taala poochhta hai kya unhon-ne jahannam dekha hai? wo jawab detey hain nahi, Allah ki qism , unhon-ne jahannam ko dekha nahi hai. Allah Taala farmata hai, phir agar unhon-ne usey dekha hota to unka kya haal hota ? wo jawab detey hain ke agar unhon-ne usey dekha hota to us se bachney mein wo sabse aagey hotey aur sabse zyada us se khof khaatey . is par Allah Taala farmata hai ke main tumhen gawah banata hun ke maine unki maghfirat ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is par unmein se aik Farishtey ne kaha ke unmein falan bhi tha jow unn zaakireen mein se nahi tha, balke wo kisi zarurat se aa gaya tha. Allah Taala irshad farmata hai ke ye (zaakireen) wo log hain jinki majlis mein baithney wala bhi naa-muraad nahi rehtaa . is hadis ko Shoba ne bhi Aamash se riwayat kya lekin isko marfoo nahi kya aur Suhel ne bhi isko apne waalidain Abu-Saleh se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6409","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik ghaati ya darrey par chadhney lagey. bayan kya ke jab aik aur sahabi bhi is par chadh gaey to unhon-ne buland awaz se (لا إله إلا الله والله أكبر‏) kaha, rawi ne bayan kya ke us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne khachchar par Sawar they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum log kisi behrey ya ghayab ko nahi pukaartey . phir farmaya, abu-Musa ya to yun (farmaayaa) aey Abdullah-bin-Qais ! kya main tumhen aik kalima na bata dun jo jannat ke khazaanon mein se hai. maine arz kya, zaroor irshad farmaein , farmaya ke (لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله)."
"6410","Allah Taala ke ninyaanwe (99) naam hain, aik kam sou (100), jo shakhs bhi unhein yad kar lega jannat mein jaeyga Allah taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai."
"6411","ham Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ka intizar kar rahe they ke Yazeed bin Muawiya aaey. ham ne kaha, tashrif rakhiye lekin unhon-ne jawab diya ke nahi, mein andar jaaunga aur tumharey sath (Abdullah-bin-Masood (rz)) ko bahar laaun ga . agar wo na aaey to main hi tanha aa jaaunga aur tumharey sath baithoon ga . phir Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) bahar tashrif laey aur wo Yazeed bin Muawiya ka hath pakdey huey they phir hamarey samney khadey huey kehney lagey main jaan gaya tha ke tum yahan maujood ho. isliye main jo nikla to is wjah se ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha aap muqarrara dinon mein ham ko waz (nasihat) farmaya kartey they, (faasla de kar) aap ka matlab ye hota tha ke kahin ham uktaa na jaaein."
"6412","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''do ne'matein aisi hain ke aksar log unki qadr nahi kartey, sihat aur faraaghat.'' Abbas Anbari ne bayan kya ke ham se Safwan bin Esa ne bayan kya, unse Abdullah-bin-Ubai Hind ne, unse unke walid ne ke maine Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi hadis ki tarah ."
"6413","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (اللهم لا عيش إلا عيش الآخره ، Mina padhi. فأصلح الأنصار والمهاجره) ''aey Allah ! aakhirat ki zindagi ke siwa aur koi zindagi nahi. isliiye to Ansar w muhajireen mein salaah ko baqi rakh.''"
"6414","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Khandaq ki jang ke mauqe par maujood they, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi khandaq khodtey jatey they aur ham mitti ko uthatey jatey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey qareeb se guzartey huey farmaatey                         (اللهم لا عيش إلا عيش الآخره ، Mina فاغفر للأنصار والمهاجره) ''aey Allah ! zindagi to bas aakhirat hi ki zindagi hai, isliiye tu ansaar w muhajireen ki maghfirat kar.'' us riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki hai."
"6415","maine aapko ye farmatey huey suna ke jannat mein aik kode jitni jagah duniya aur is mein jo kuchh hai sabse behtar hai aur Allah ke rastey mein subah ko ya Sham ko thoda sa chalnaa bhi duniya aur jo kuch usmein hai se behtar hai."
"6416","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera shana pakad kar farmaya ''duniyaa mein is tarah ho ja jaisey to musaafir ya rasta chalney wala ho.''  Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) farmaya kartey they Sham ho jaey to subah ke muntazir na raho aur subah ke waqt Sham (Syria) ke muntazir na raho, apni seihat ko marz se pahley ghaneemat jano aur zindagi ko maut se pahley ."
"6417","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaukhtaa khat kheenchaa . phir iske darmyan aik khat kheenchaa jo chaukhtey ke darmyan mein tha. iske baad darmyan waley khat ke us hissey mein jo chaukhtey ke darmyan mein tha chhotey chhotey bahut se khutoot kheenchey aur phir farmaya ke ye insan hai aur ye uski maut hai jo usey gherey huey hai aur ye jo (beech ka ( khat bahar nikla hua hai wo uski ummeed hai aur chhotey chhotey khutoot uski duniyawi mushkilaat hain. isliiye insan jab aik (mushkil) se bach kar nikalta hai to dusri mein phans jata hai aur dusri se nikalta hai to teesri mein phans jata hai."
"6418","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand khutoot kheenchey aur farmaya ke ye ummeed hai aur ye maut hai, insan usi haalat (ummeed tak pahunchne ki) mein rehta hai ke qareeb wala khat (maut) us tak pahunch jata hai."
"6419","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne us aadmi ke uzr ke silsiley mein hujjat tamam kar di jiski maut ko dair huii  yahan tak ke wo saa'tth (60) saal ki umr ko pahunch gaya. ''us riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) abu-Hazim aur ibne-ajlaan ne Maqbari se ki."
"6420","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''boodhey insan ka dil do chizon ke barey mein hamesha jawan rehtaa hai, duniya ki mohabbat aur zindagi ki lambi ummeed.'' Leis ne bayan kya ke mujh se Yunus ne bayan kya aur Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se bayan kya ke mujhey Saeed aur abu-Salma ne khabar di."
"6421","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' insan ki umr badhtii jati hai aur uske sath do cheezein uske andar badhtii jati hain. maal ki mohabbat aur umr ki daraazii.'' uski riwayat Shoba ne Qatada se ki hai."
"6422","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye baat khub mere zahan mein mehfooz hai. unhein yad hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke aik dol mein se pani lekar mujh par kulli kar di thi."
"6423","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey aur farmaya ''koii banda jab qiyamat ke din us haalat mein pesh hoga ke usne kalima ( لا إله إلا الله (ka iqrar kya hoga aur is se uska maqsad Allah ki khushnoodii hasil karna hogi to Allah Taala dozakh ki aag ko is par haram kar dega.''"
"6424","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke mere us momin bandey ka jis ki, mein koi azeez cheez duniya se utha loon aur wo is par sawab ki niyat se sabr kar ley , to uska badla mere yahan jannat ke siwa aur kuchh nahi. ''"
"6425","Amr-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) jo bani Aamir bin Adi ke dost they aur badr ki ladai main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, unhon-ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Ubaida bin Jarrah (Raziallahu anhu) ko Bahrain wahan ka jiziya laney ke liye bhejaa, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bahrain walon se suleh kar li thi aur un par Alaa-bin-Al-Hizramii (الحضرمی) ko ameer muqarrar kya tha. jab abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) Bahrain se jiziya ka maal lekar aaey to Ansar ne unke aaney ke mutaalliq suna aur subah ki Namaz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padhi aur jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein dekh kar muskuraaey aur farmaya mera khayal hai ke abu-Ubaida ke aaney ke mutaalliq tum ne sun liya hai aur ye bhi ke wo kuchh lekar aaey hain? Ansar ne arz kya : ji haan , ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tumhen khushkhabri ho tum uski ummeed rakho jo tumhen khush kar degi , Allah ki qism ! ghariibii w mohtaajii wo cheez nahi hai jis se main tumharey mutaalliq darta hun balke main to us se darta hun ke duniya tum par bhi isi tarah kushaada kar di jaeygi, jis tarah un logon par kar di gaee thi jo tum se pahley they aur tum bhi uske liye aik doosrey se aagey badhney ki isi tarah koshish karogey jis tarah wo kartey they aur tumhen bhi isi tarah ghaafil kar degi jis tarah unko ghaafil kya tha."
"6426","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur jange-Uhud ke shaheedon ke liye is tarah Namaz padhi jis tarah murda par Namaz padhi jati hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimber par tashrif laey aur farmaya aakhirat mein main tum se aagey jaaunga aur main tum par gawah hunga , Allah ki qism main apne hauz ko us waqt bhi dekh raha hun aur mujhey zameen ke khazaanon ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain ya (farmaayaa ke) zameen ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain aur Allah ki qism ! main tumharey mutaalliq us se nahi darta ke tum mere baad shirk karogey balke mujhey tumharey mutaalliq ye khof hai ke tum duniya ke liye aik doosrey se aagey badhney ki koshish karne lago gey ."
"6427","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumharey mutaalliq sabse zyada us se khof khata hon ke jab Allah Taala zameen ki barkatein tumharey liye nikal dega. puchha gaya zameen ki barkatein kya hain? farmaya ke duniya ki chamak damak , is par aik sahabi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha kya bhalai se burai paida ho sakti hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par khamosh ho gaey aur ham ne khayal kya ke shayad aap par wahi nazil ho rahi hai. iske baad apni peshani ko saaf karne lagey aur malum farmaya, poochhney waley kahan hain? poochhney waley ne kaha ke hazir hun. Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab us sawal ka hal hamarey samney aa gaya to ham ne un sahib ki tareef ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bhalai se to sirf bhalai hi paida hoti hai lekin ye maal sar-sabz aur khushgawaar (ghaas ki tarah) hai aur jo cheez bhi Rabe ke mausam mein ugtii hain wo laalech ke sath khaney walon ko halaak kar deti hain ya halaakat ke qareeb pahuncha deti hain. siwaey us janwar ke jo pet bhar ke khaaey ke jab us ne kha liya aur uski donon kokh bhar gain to usne suraj ki taraf munh karke jugaalii kar li aur phir pakhana peshab kar diya aur uske baad phir lot ke kha liya aur ye maal bhi bahut meethaa hai jisne usey haq ke sath liya aur haq mein kharch kya to wo behtreen zariia' hai aur jisne usey naajaaiz tareeqe se hasil kya to wo us shakhs jaisa hai jo khata hai lekin ranjeedaa nahi hota."
"6428","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein sabse behtar mera zamana hai, phir un logon ka zamana hai jo uske baad hongey. '' Imran ne bayan kya ke mujhey nahi malum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat ko do martaba dohraya ya teen martaba . phir iske baad wo log hongey ke wo gawahi dengey lekin unki gawahi qabool nahi ki jaeygi, wo khayanat karengey aur un par se bharosaa jata rahega. wo nazar maanein gey lekin poori nahi karengey aur unmein mutaapaa phail jaeyga"
"6429","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse behtar mera zamana hai, iske baad un logon ka jo iske baad hongey phir jo unke baad hongey aur uske baad aisey log paida hongey jo qism se pehley gawahi dengey kabhi gawahi se pehley qism khaaengey.''"
"6430","maine Khubbaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, us din unke pet mein saat (7) dagh lagaey gaey they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar hamein maut ki dua karne se mana na kya hota to main apni maut ki dua karta. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba guzar gaey aur duniya ne unke (aa'maal khair mein se) kuchh nahi ghataayaa aur ham ne duniya se itna kuchh hasil kya ke mitti ke siwa uski koi jagah nahi."
"6431","main Khubbaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, wo apne makan ki diwar banwaa rahe they, unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey sathi jo guzar gaey duniya ne unke nek aamaal mein se kuchh kami nahi ki lekin unke baad ham ko itna paisaa (پیسہ) mila ke ham usko kahan kharch karein bas is mitti aur pani yani Imaarat mein ham ko usey kharch ka mauqa mila hai."
"6432","ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath hijrat ki thi aur iska qissa bayan kya."
"6433","main Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye wuzu ka pani lekar aaya wo chabootrey par baithey huey they, phir unhon-ne achi tarah wuzu kya. iske baad kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko isi jagah wuzu kartey huey dekha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne achi tarah wuzu kya, phir farmaya ke jisne is tarah wuzu kya aur phir masjid mein aa kar do rakaat Namaz padhi to uske pichhley gunah maaf ho jatey hain. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par ye bhi farmaya ke is par maghroor (مغرور) na ho jao."
"6434","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''neik log ek baad doosrey guzar jaeinge iske baad jau ke bhoosey ya khajoor ke kachrey ki tarah kuchh log duniya mein reh jaeinge jinki Allah paak ko kuchh zara bhi parwaa na hogi. '' imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha (حفالة) aur (حثالة‏ ( donon ke aik mana hain."
"6435","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''diinaar w dirham ke bandey , umda reshamii chaadaron ke bandey , siyah kamlii ke bandey , tabah ho gaey ke agar unhein diya jaey to wo khush ho jatey hain aur agar na diya jaey to naraz rahtey hain.''"
"6436","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar insan ke paas maal ki do wadiyan hon to teesri ka khaahishmand hoga aur insan ka pait mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur Allah us shakhs ki tauba qabool karta hai jo (dil se) sachchii tauba karta hai.''"
"6437","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar insan ke paas maal ( bhaid-bakrii ( ki poori wadi ho to wo chaahega ke usey waisii hi aik aur mil jaey aur insan ki aankh mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur jo Allah se tauba karta hai, wo uski tauba qabool karta hai'' Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey malum nahi ye Quran mein se hai ya nahi. bayan kya ke maine ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye member par kehtey suna tha."
"6438","maine Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko Makka Mukarrama mein member par ye kehtey suna. unhon-ne apne khutbe mein kaha ke aey logo ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke agar insan ko aik wadi sona bhar ke de diya jaey to wo dusri ka khaahishmand rahega agar dusri de di jaey to teesri ka khaahishmand rahega aur insan ka pet mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur Allah paak uski tauba qabool karta hai jo tauba kare."
"6439","aur unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar insan ke paas soney ki aik wadi ho to wo chaahega ke 2 ho jayen aur iska munh qabr ki mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur Allah uski tauba qabool karta hai jo tauba kare. ''"
"6440","ham usey Quran hi mein se samajhtey they yahan tak ke aayat (ألهاكم التكاثر‏) nazil hui."
"6441","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey ata farmaya, maine phir maanga aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir ata farmaya, maine phir maanga aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir ata farmaya, phir farmaya ke ye maal aur kabhi-kabhi Sufiyan ne yun bayan kya ke (hakeem (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya) aey hakeem ! ye maal sar-sabz aur khushgawaar nazar aata hai isliye jo shakhs usey nek niyatii (نیتی) se ley usmein barkat hoti hai aur jo laalach ke sath leta hai to uske maal mein barkat nahi hoti balke wo us shakhs jaisa ho jata hai jo khata jata hai lekin uska pet nahi bharta aur uper ka hath nichey ke hath se behtar hai."
"6442","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein kon hai jisey apne maal se zyada apne waaris ka maal pyara ho.'' sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham mein koi aisa nahi jisey maal zyada pyara na ho. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya'' phir uska maal wo hai jo usney (maut se) pahley (Allah ke raaste mein kharch) kya aur uske waaris ka maal wo hai jo wo chhod kar maraa .''"
"6443","aik roz mein bahar nikla to dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tanha chal rahe they aur aap ke sath koi bhi na tha, Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke is se main samjha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isey pasand nahi farmaaengey ke aap ke sath us waqt koi rahe. isliye main chaand ke saaey main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey-peechhey chalney laga. iske baad aap mudey to mujhey dekha aur malum farmaya kon hai? maine arz kya : abu-Zar! Allah mujhey aap par qurbaan kare. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Zar! yahan aao. bayan kya ke phir main thodi der tak aap ke sath chalta raha. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo log (duniyaa mein) zyada maal w daulat jama kiye huey hain qiyamat ke din wahi khasaarey mein hongey. siwaey unke jinhein Allah Taala ne maal diya ho aur unhon-ne usey daaein baaein, aagey-peechhey kharch kya ho aur usey bhaley kaamon mein lagaya ho. (abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne) bayan kya ke phir thodi der tak main aap ke sath chalta raha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, baith jao. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aik hamwaar zameen par bitha diya jiske charon taraf patthar they aur farmaya ke haan, us waqt tak baithey raho jab tak main tumharey paas lot aaoon. phir aap pathreelii zameen ki taraf chaley gaey aur nazron se ojhal ho gaey. aap wahan rahe aur der tak wahin rahe. phir maine aap se suna, aap ye kehtey huey tashrif la rahe they '' chahey chori ho, chahey zina ho '' Abu-Zar kehtey hain ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to mujh se sabr nahi ho saka aur maine arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! Allah aap par mujhey qurbaan kare. is pathreelii zameen ke kinarey aap kis se baatein kar rahe they. maine to kisi doosrey ko aap se baat kartey nahi dekhaa? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) they. pathreelii zameen (Harra) ke kinarey wo mujh se miley aur kaha ke apni ummat ko khushkhabri suna do ke jo bhi us haal mein marega ke Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko Sharik na thahraataa ho to wo jannat mein jaeyga maine arz kya : aey Jibraaiil! chahe us ne chori ki ho, zina kya ho? Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha haan, chahe usne sharab hi pi ho. nazar ne bayan kya ke hamein Shoba ne khabar di (kahaa) ham se Habib bin abi saabit, Aamash aur Abdul-Azeez bin rafeea' ne bayan kya, unse Zaid-bin Wahab ne isi tarah bayan kya. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha Abu-Saleh ne jo usi baab mein abu-Darda se riwayat ki hai wo munqata' hai) Abu-Saleh ne abu-Darda se nahi suna (aur sahi nahi hai ham ne ye bayan kar diya taake us hadis ka haal malum ho jaey aur sahi Abu-Zar ki hadis hai (jo uper mazkoor hui ( kisi ne imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se puchha Ata-bin-Yasar ne bhi to ye hadis abu-Darda se riwayat ki hai. unhon-ne kaha wo bhi munqata' hai aur sahi nahi hai. aakhir sahi wahi Abu-Zar ki hadis niklii. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha abu-Darda ki hadis ko chhodo (wo sanad leney ke laaiq nahi hai kyonke wo munqata' hai) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke Abu-Zar ki hadis ka matlab ye hai ke martey waqt aadmi ( لا إله إلا الله ( kahey aur tauheed par khaatma ho (to wo aik na aik din zaroor jannat mein jaeyga chahey kitna hi gunahgaar ho) . kuchh nuskhon mein ye hai) هذا اذا تاب وقال لا إله إلا الله عند الموت ( yani Abu-Zar ki hadis us shakhs ke barey mein hai jo gunah se tauba karey aur martey waqt ( لا إله إلا الله ( kahey ."
"6444","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke pathreeley ilaqe mein chal raha tha ke Uhud pahaad hamarey samney aa gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya : Abu-Zar ! maine arz kya, hazir hun ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey is se bilkul khushi nahi hogi ke mere paas is Uhud ke barabar sona ho aur is par teen din is tarah guzar jayen ke usmein se aik Dinar bhi baqi reh jaey siwa us thodi si raqam ke jo main qarz ki adaaeygi ke liye chhod dun balke mein usey Allah ke bandon mein is tarah kharch karun apni daain taraf se, baain taraf se aur peechhey se. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaltey rahe, iske baad farmaya, zyada maal jama rakhney waley hi qiyamat ke din muflis hongey siwa us shakhs ke jo us maal ko is-is tarah daain taraf se, baain taraf se aur peechhey se kharch karey aur aisey log kam hain. phir mujh se farmaya, yahin thahrey raho, yahan se us waqt tak na jana jab tak main aa na jaun. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ki taareeki mein chaley gaey aur nazron se ojhal ho gaey. iske baad maine awaz suni jo buland thi. mujhey dar laga ke kahin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko koi dushwari na pesh aa gaee ho. maine aap ki khidmat mein pahunchne ka irada kya lekin aap ka irshad yad aaya ke apni jagah se na hatna , jab tak main na aa jaun. chunanche jab tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif nahi laey main wahan se nahi hataa. phir aap aaey maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maine aik awaz suni thi, mujhey dar laga lekin phir aap ka irshad yad aaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya kya tum ne suna tha? maine arz kya, ji haan. farmaya ke wo Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) they aur unhon-ne kaha ke aap ki ummat ka jo shakhs is haal mein mar jaey ke usne Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik na kya ho to jannat mein jaeyga maine puchha chahe us ne zina aur chori bhi ki ho? unhon-ne kaha haan zina aur chori hi kyon na ki ho."
"6445","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar mere paas Uhud pahaad ke barabar bhi sona ho to mujhey usmein khushi hogi ke teen din bhi mujh par is haal mein na guzarney paaein ke usmein se mere paas kuchh bhi baqi bachchey . albatta agar kisi ka qarz door karne ke liye kuchh rakh chhodun to ye aur baat hai."
"6446","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''maaldaarii ye nahi hai ke saman zyada ho, balke maaldaarii ye hai ke dil ghanii (maaldaar) ho. ''"
"6447","aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney se guzra to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik doosrey shakhs Abu-Zar-Ghifaarii (Raziallahu anhu) se jo aap ke qareeb baithey huey they, puchha ke us shakhs ( guzrey waale) ke mutaalliq tum kya kehtey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke ye muazzaz logon mein se hai aur Allah ki qism ! ye is qaabil hai ke agar ye paighaame-nikaah bhejey to us se nikah kar diya jaey. agar ye sifarish karey to unki sifarish qabool kar li jaey. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye sun kar khamosh ho gaey. iske baad aik doosrey sahib guzrey . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse unke mutaalliq bhi puchha ke unke barey mein tumhari kya raey hai? unhon-ne kaha, ya Rasulullah ! ye sahib musalmanon ke ghareeb tabqey se hain aur ye aisey hain ke agar ye nikah ka paigham bhejein to unka nikah na kya jaey, agar ye kisi ki sifarish karein to unki sifarish qabool na ki jaey aur agar kuchh kahein to unki baat na suni jaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad farmaya ke Allah ke nazdeek ye pichhlaa mohtaaj shakhs agley maaldaar shakhs se, bhale hi waisey aadmi zameen bhar kar hon, behtar hai."
"6448","ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Allah Taala ki raza hasil karne ke liye hijrat ki. chunanche hamara ajr Allah ke zimme raha. to ham mein se koi to guzar gaya aur apna ajr (is duniya mein) nahi liya. Mus'ab-bin-Umair (Raziallahu anhu)) unhi ( mein se they, wo jange-Uhud ke mauqe par Shahid ho gaey they aur aik chadar chhodi thi (is chadar ka unko kafan diya gaya tha) us chadar se ham agar unka sar dhaktey to unke paon khul jatey aur paon dhaktey to sar khul jata. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham unka sar dhak dein aur paon par izkhir ghaas daal dein aur koi ham mein se aisey huey jinke phal khub pakey aur wo mazey se chun chun kar kha rahe hain."
"6449","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''maine jannat mein jhanka to usmein rehney waley aksar ghareeb log they aur maine dozakh mein jhanka to uski rehney waaliyaan aksar auratein thin. ''abu-Rijaa ke sath is hadis ko Ayub sakhtiyan aur Auf ne bhi riwayat kya hai aur sakhr bin Juweriya aur Hammad bin najeeh donon is hadis ko abu-Rijaa se, unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya."
"6450","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi mez par khana nahi khaayaa. yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gaee aur na wafat tak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi baareek chapaatii khaaii."
"6451","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to mere toshey-khaane mein koi ghalla na tha jo kisi jaandaar ke khaney ke qaabil hota, siwa thodey se jau ke jo mere toshey mein they, main unmein hi se khaatii rahi aakhir uktaa kar jab bahut din ho gaey to maine unhein naapaa to wo khatm ho gaey."
"6452","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they ke Allah ki qism jiske siwa koi maabood nahi main (zamaana nabwi mein) bhook ke maarey zameen par apne pet ke bal let jata tha aur kabhi main bhook ke maarey apne pet par patthar baandha karta tha. aik din mein us rastey par baith gaya jis se sahaba nikaltey they Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) guzrey aur maine unse kitabullah ki aik aayat ke barey mein poochha, mere poochhney ka maqsad sirf ye tha ke wo mujhey kuchh khilaa dein magar wo chaley gaey aur kuchh nahi kya. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas se guzrey, maine unse bhi Quran Majeed ki aik aayat poochhi aur poochhney ka maqsad sirf ye tha ke wo mujhey kuchh khilaa dein magar wo bhi guzar gaey aur kuchh nahi kya. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guzrey aur aap ne jab mujhey dekha to aap muskuraa diye aur jo mere dil main aur jo mere chehrey par tha aap ne pehchan liya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Huraira! maine arz kya labbaik, ya Rasulullah ! farmaya mere sath aa jao aur aap chalney lagey. main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey chal diya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar ghar mein tashrif ley gaey. phir maine ijazat chahi aur mujhey ijazat milii. jab aap dakhil huey to aik pyaley mein doodh mila. malum farmaya ke ye doodh kahan se aaya hai? kaha falan ya fulaanii ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye tohfe mein bheja hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Huraira! maine arz kya labbaik, ya Rasulullah ! farmaya, ahale-suffa ke paas jao aur unhein bhi mere paas bula laao. kaha ke ahale-suffa Islam ke mehmaan hain, wo na kisi ke ghar panah dhoondhtey , na kisi ke maal main aur na kisi ke paas ! jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas sadqa aata to usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhiin ke paas bhej detey aur khud usmein se kuchh na rakhtey. albatta jab aap ke paas tohfa aata to unhein bulwa bhejtey aur khud bhi usmein se kuchh khaatey aur unhein bhi Sharik kartey. chunanche mujhey ye baat na-gawar guzri aur maine sochaa ke ye doodh hai hi kitna ke sarey suffa walon mein taqseem ho, iska haqdaar main tha ke usey pi kar kuchh quwwat hasil karta. jab suffa waley aaeingey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujh se farmaaengey aur main unhein usey de doonga . mujhey to shayad us doodh mein se kuchh bhi nahi milega lekin Allah aur uske rasool ki hukm-bardaarii ke siwa koi aur chaara bhi nahi tha. chunanche main unke paas aaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dawat pahunchaaii, wo aagey aur ijazat chaahi. unhein ijazat mil gaee phir wo ghar main apni apni jagah baith gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : abu-Huraira! maine arz kya labbaik , ya Rasulullah ! farmaya lo aur usey un sab haaziriin ko de do. bayan kya ke phir maine piyala pakad liya aur eik-eik ko diye laga. aik shakhs doodh pi kar jab sairaab ho jata to mujhey piyala wapas kar deta phir doosrey shakhs ko deta wo bhi sairaab ho kar peetaa phir piyala mujh ko wapas kar deta aur isi tarah teesra pi kar phir mujhey piyala wapas kar deta. is tarah main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahuncha log pi kar sairaab ho chukey they. aakhir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne piyala pakda aur apne hath par rakh kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri taraf dekha aur muskuraa kar farmaya, abu-Huraira! maine arz kya, labbaik, ya Rasulullah! farmaya, ab main aur tum baqi reh gaey hain. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ne sach farmaya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya baith jao aur piyo . main baith gaya aur maine doodh piyaa aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) barabar farmatey rahe ke aur piyo aakhir mujhey kehna padaa, nahi us zaat ki qism jisne aapko haq ke sath bheja hai, ab bilkul gunjaaish nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, phir mujhey de do, maine piyala Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko de diya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur bismillaah padh kar bacha hua khud pi gaey."
"6453","main sabse pahlaa Arab hun jisne Allah ke rastey mein teer chillaey . ham ne us haal mein waqt guzara hai ke jihad kar rahe hain aur hamarey paas khaney ki koi cheez habla ke patton aur us babool ke siwa khaney ke liye nahi thi aur bakri ki mengniyon ki tarah ham pakhana kiya kartey they. ab ye banu-Asad ke log mujh ko Islam sikhlaa kar durust karna chahtey hain phir to main bilkul bad-naseeb thehra aur mera Sara kya karaya akaarat gaya."
"6454","Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ko Madina aaney ke baad kabhi teen din tak barabar gehun ki roti khaney ke liye nahi mili , yahan tak ki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rooh qabz ho gaee."
"6455","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke gharaane ne agar kabhi aik din mein 2 martaba khana khaya to zaroor usmein aik waqt sirf khajoorein hoti thin."
"6456","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bistar chamdey ka tha aur is mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi."
"6457","ham Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hotey, unka naan baaii wahin maujood hota (jo rotiyaan pakka pakaa kar deta jaataa) Anas (Raziallahu anhu) logon se kehtey ke khaao, maine kabhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko patlii roti khaatey nahi dekha aur na Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi apni aankh se samoochii bhunii hui bakri dekhi. yahan tak ke aap ka intiqal ho gaya."
"6458","hamarey uper aisa mahina bhi guzar jata tha ke choolha nahi jaltaa tha, sirf khajoor aur pani hota tha, haan agar kabhi kisi jagah se kuchh thoda sa gosht aa jata to usko bhi kha letey they."
"6459","unhon-ne Urwa se kaha, betey! ham 2 mahinon mein teen chaand dekh letey hain aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki beeviyon) ke gharon mein choolha nahi jaltaa tha. maine puchha phir aap log zinda kis cheez par rehti thin ? batlaya ke sirf 2 kali chizon par, khajoor aur pani . haan , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kuchh Ansari padosi they jinke yahan dudhail oontniyan thin wo apne gharon se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye doodh bhej detey aur aap hamein wahi doodh pilaa detey they."
"6460","ham se Abdullah-bin Muhammad ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se Muhammad-bin-Fuzail ne bayan kya, unse unke walid ne, unse Umara ne, unse Abu-Zaraa ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne duaa ki ke aey Allaah! aale-Muhammad ko itnii rozii dey ke wo zinda reh sakein."
"6461","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se poochha, kon si ibadat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada pasand thi, farmaya ke jis par hameshgii ho sakey, kaha ke maine puchha aap raat ko tahajjud ke liye Kab uthtey they? batlaya ke jab murgh ki awaz sun letey."
"6462","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sabse zyada pasandida wo amal tha jis ko aadmi hamesha karta rahe."
"6463","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum se kisi shakhs ko iska amal nijat nahi dila sakega.'' sahaba ne kaha aur aapko bhi nahi ya rasoolullaah? farmaya ''aur mujhey bhi nahi, siwa iske ke Allah Taala mujhey apni rehmat ke saaye mein ley ley. to tum ko chahiye ke durustii ke sath amal karo aur miyaanaa rawii ikhtiyar karo. subah aur Shaam, isi tarah raat ko zara sa chal liya karo aur aetidaal ke sath chala karo manzil maqsud ko pahunch jaogey .''"
"6621","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) kabhi apni qism nahi todtey they, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne qism ka kaffara utaaraa. us waqt unhon-ne kaha ke ab agar main koi qism khaaunga aur uske siwa koi cheez bhalai ki hogi to main wahi kaam karunga jis mein bhalai ho aur apni qism ka kaffara de doonga ."
"6622","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Abdur-Rehman bin Samra ! kabhi kisi hukumat ke ohda ki darkhaast na karna kyonke agar tumhen ye maangney ke baad milega to Allah paak apni madad tujh se utha lega, to jaan , tera kaam janey aur agar wo ohda tumhen baghair maangey mil gaya to usmein Allah ki taraf se tumhari iaa'nat ki jaeygi aur jab tum koi qism kha lo aur uske siwa kisi aur cheez mein bhalai dekho to apni qism ka kaffara de do aur wo kaam karo jo bhalai ka ho."
"6623","mein Ash-ari qabeele ki aik jamat ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur aap se sawari mangi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism , main tumharey liye sawari ka koi intizam nahi kar sakta aur na mere paas koi sawari ka janwar hai. bayan kya phir jitney dinon Allah ne chaha ham yoonhii thahrey rahe. iske baad teen achi qism ki oontniyan laai gain aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hamein sawari ke liye inayat farmaya, jab ham rawaana huey to ham ne kaha ya ham mein se kuchh ne kaha, Allah ki qism ! hamein usmein barkat nahi hasil hogi. ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein sawari maangney aaey they, to aap ne qism kha li thi ke aap hamarey liye sawari ka intizam nahi kar saktey aur ab aap ne hamein sawari inayat farmai hai hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jana chahiye aur aapko qism yad dilaanii chahiye chunanche ham aap ki khidmat mein hazir huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhari sawari ka koi intizam nahi kya hai balke Allah Taala ne ye intizam kya hai aur main, Allah ki qasam! koi bhi qism agar kha loonga aur uske siwa kisi aur cheez mein bhalai dekhoonga to apni qism ka kaffara de doonga. jis mein bhalai hogi ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun farmaya ke wahi karunga jis mein bhalai hogi aur apni qism ka kaffara ada kar doonga."
"6624","ye wo hadis hai jo ham se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ''ham aakhiri ummat hain aur qiyamat ke din jannat mein sabse pahley dakhil hongey. ''"
"6625","phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism ( kabhi-kabhi ( apne ghar walon ke maamle main tumhara apni qasmon par israar kartey rehna Allah ke nazdeek us se zyada gunah ki baat hoti hai ke) qism tod kar) uska wo kaffara ada kar diya jaey jo Allah Taala ne is par farz kya hai."
"6626","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''wo shakhs jo apne ghar walon ke maamle mein qism par ada rehta hai wo us se bada gunah karta hai ke is qism ka kaffara ada kar de. ''"
"6627","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik fauj bheji aur uska ameer Usama-bin-Zaid ko banaya. kuchh logon ne unke ameer banaey janey par aetraz kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur farmaya ke agar tum log iske ameer banaey janey par aetraz kartey ho to tum us se pahley iske walid Zaid ke ameer banaey janey par bhi aetraz kar chukey ho aur Allah ki qism ! Zaid ameer banaey janey ke qaabil they aur mujhey sab logon se zyada azeez they aur ye ( Usama ( unke baad mujhey sabse zyada azeez they."
"6628","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qism bas itni thi ke nahi ! dilon ke pherney waley Allah ki qism ."
"6629","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab qaisar halaak ho jaeyga to phir uske baad koi qaisar nahi paida hoga aur jab Kisraa halaak ho jaeyga to iske baad koi Kisraa nahi paida hoga aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai tum unke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein kharch karogey.''"
"6630","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Kisraa ( badshah Iraan ( halaak ho jaeyga to iske baad koi Kisraa nahi paida hoga aur jab qaisar ( badshah Rome (mojooda Itly) ( halaak ho jaeyga to iske baad koi qaisar nahi paida hoga aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai tum unke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein kharch karogey. ''"
"6631","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey ummate-Muhammad ! Allah ki qism , agar tum wo jantey jo main janta hun to zyada rotey aur kam hanstey.''"
"6632","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aur aap umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka hath pakdey huey they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap mujhey har cheez se zyada azeez hain, siwa meri apni jaan ke. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. (eman us waqt tak mukammal nahi ho sakta ( jab tak main tumhen tumhari apni jaan se bhi zyada azeez na ho jaun. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : phir Allah ki qism ! ab aap mujhey meri apni jaan se bhi zyada azeez hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, umr ! ab tera eman pura hua."
"6634","2 aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein apna jhagdaa pesh kya. unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamarey darmyan aap kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. doosrey ne, jo zyada samajh daar tha kaha ke theek hai, ya Rasulullah ! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dijiye aur mujhey ijazat dijiye ke is maamle mein kuchh arz karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho. un sahib ne kaha ke mera ladka is shakhs ke yahan ( Aseef ( tha. ( Aseef ), Mina ( الأجير ( ko kehtey hain. ( الأجير (ke mana mazdoor ke hain) aur us ne uski biwi se zina kar liya. unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke ab mere ladkey ko sangsaar kya jaeyga isliye (is se nijat dilaane ke liye) maine so bakriyon aur aik londi ka unhein fidya de diya phir maine doosrey ilm walon se is mas'ale ko puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza ye hai ke usey so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaey, sangsaari ki saza sirf us aurat ko hogi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga . tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hogi aur phir aap ne iske ladkey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye jalaa watan kar diya. phir aap ne Anees Aslami se farmaya ke muddaii ki biwi ko laey aur agar wo zina ka iqrar karey to usey sangsaar kar de. us aurat ne zina ka iqrar kar liya aur sangsaar kar di gaee."
"6635","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' bhala batlao Aslam, ghifaar, muzena aur juhaina ke qabeeley agar Tameem, Aamir bin sa'sa'a, Ghatfan aur Asad walon se behtar hon to ye Tameem aur Aamir aur Ghatfan aur Asad waley ghaatey mein padey aur nuqsan mein rahe ya nahi. sahaba ne arz kya : ji haan beshak. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par phir farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai (wo pahley jin qabaayel ka zikr hua) un (Tameem wghaira) se behtar hain."
"6636","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aamil (governor) muqarrar kya. aamil apne kaam poorey karke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye maal aap ka hai aur ye maal mujhey tohfa diya gaya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum apne maan-baap ke ghar hi mein kyon nahi baithey rahe aur phir dekhtey ke tumhen koi tohfa deta hai ya nahi. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutbe ke liye khadey huey, raat ki Namaz ke baad aur kalima shahadat aur Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq sana ke baad farmaya ammaa ba'd! aisey aamil ko kya ho gaya hai ke ham usey aamil banatey hain. ( jiziya aur doosrey tax wsool karne ke liye) aur wo phir hamarey paas aa kar kehta hai ke ye to aap ka tax hai aur mujhey tohfa diya gaya hai. phir wo apne maan-baap ke ghar kyon nahi betha aur dekhta ke usey tohfa diya jata hai ya nahi. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum mein se koi bhi us maal mein se kuchh bhi khayanat karega to qiyamat ke din usey apni gardan par uthaaeyga. agar oont ki us ne khayanat ki hogi to us haal mein lekar aayega ke awaz nikal rahi hogi. agar gaaey ki khayanat ki hogi to us haal mein usey lekar aayega ke gaaey ki awaz aa rahi hogi. agar bakri ki khayanat ki hogi to us haal mein aayega ke bakri ki awaz aa rahi hogi. bas maine tum tak pahuncha diya. abu-Humed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath itni uper uthaya ke ham aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhney lagey. abu-Humed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke mere sath ye hadis Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thi, tum log unse bhi poochh lo."
"6637","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us zaat ki qism ! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar tum bhi aakhirat ki wo mushkilaat jantey jo main janta hun to tum zyada rotey aur kam hanstey.''"
"6638","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahuncha to aap Kaba ke saaye mein baithey huey farma rahe they Kaba ke rab ki qism ! wahi sabse zyada khasaarey waley hain. Kaba ke rab ki qism ! wahi sabse zyada khasaarey waley hain. maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! meri haalat kaisi hai, kya mujh main ( bhi) koi aisi baat nazar aai hai? meri haalat kaisi hai? phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baith gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ja rahe they, mein aapko khamosh nahi kara sakta tha aur Allah ki marzi ke mutabiq mujh par ajeeb be-qaraarii taarii ho gaee. maine phir arz ki, mere maan-baap aap par fidaa hon, ya Rasulullah ! wo kon log hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye wo log hain jinke paas maal zyada hai. lekin us se wo mustashnaa hain. jinhoney usmein se is-is tarah (yani daaein aur baaein be-daregh mustahiqeen par) Allah ki raah mein kharch kya hoga."
"6639","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ne aik din kaha ke aaj main raat main apni nawwey beeviyon ke paas jaaunga aur har aik ke yahan aik ghud-sawaar bachcha paida hoga jo Allah ke raaste mein jihad karega . is par unke sathi ne kaha ke inshaAllah . lekin Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ne inshaAllah nahi kaha, chunanche wo apni tamam beeviyon ke paas gaey lekin aik aurat ke siwa kisi ko hamal nahi hua aur us se bhi naaqis bachcha paida hua aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai ! agar unhon-ne inshaAllah keh diya hota to ( tamam beeviyon ke yahan bachchey paida hotey (aur sab ghodon par Sawar ho kar Allah ke rastey mein jihad karne waley hotey .''"
"6640","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein resham ka aik tukda hadiya ke taur par aaya to log usey dast badast apne hathon mein leney lagey aur uski khoobsoortii aur narmii par hairat karne lagey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke tumhen is par hairat hai? sahaba ne kaha ji haan , ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ke roomaal jannat mein us se bhi achchhey hain. Shoba aur Israel ne Abu-Ishaq se alfaz ''us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai'' ka zikr nahi kya."
"6641","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Hind binte- Utba-bin- Rabee (Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki maan ( ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! saari zameen par jitney derney waley hain (yani Arab log jo aksar deron aur khemon mein raha kartey they) mein kisi ka zaleel w khuwaar hona mujh ko itna pasand nahi tha jitna aap kaa. Yahya-bin-Bukair rawi ko shak hai ab koi dere wala ya derey waley unko izzat aur aabroo hasil hona mujh ko aap ke derney walon se zyada pasand nahi hai (yani ab main aap ki aur musalmanon ki sabse zyada khair-khaah hun) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke abhi kya hai to aur bhi zyada khair-khaah banegii. qism hai uski jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai. phir Hind kehney lagi ya Rasulullah! Abu-Sufiyan to aik kanjoos aadmi hai mujh par gunah to nahi hoga agar main iske maal mein se (apne baal bachchon ko khilaaun) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya nahi agar to dastoor ke muwafiq kharch kare."
"6642","aik mauqe par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab yamnii chamdey ke kheme se pusht lagaey huey baithey they, to aap ne apne sahaba se farmaya kya tum is par khush ho ke tum ahle-jannat ke aik chothai raho? unhon-ne arz kya, kyon nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke tum ahle-jannat ke aik tehai hissey paogey sahaba ne arz kya kyon nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya, to us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! mujhey ummeed hai ke jannat mein aadhey tum hi hogey."
"6643","aik sahabi ne suna ke aik doosrey sahabi sura ikhlas baar-baar padhtey hain jab subah hui to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya, wo sahabi is sura ko kam samajhtey they lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ye Quran Majeed ke aik tehai hisse ke barabar hai."
"6644","unhon-ne Nabi Karim kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke rukoo aur sajda poorey taur par ada kya karo. Allah ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main apni kamar ke peechhey se tum ko dekh leta hun jab rukoo aur sajda kartey ho."
"6645","Ansari khatun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin, unke sath unke bachchey bhi they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai tum log bhi mujhey tamam logon mein sabse zyada azeez ho. ye alfaz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen martaba farmaaey."
"6646","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey to wo sawaaron ki aik jamat ke sath chal rahe they aur apne bap ki qism kha rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khabardaar tahqeeq Allah Taala ne tumhen bap daadon ki qism khaney se mana kya hai, jisey qism khaani hai usey chahiye ke Allah hi ki qism khaaey warna chup rahe."
"6647","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke Allah Taala ne tumhen bap daadon ki qism khaney se mana kya hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya Allah ki qism ! phir maine unki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se manaahii sunney ke baad kabhi qism nahi khaaii na apni taraf se ghairullaah ki qism khaaii na kisi doosrey ki zaban se naql ki. Mujahid ne kaha sura ehqaaf mein jo أثرة من علم hai iska mana ye hai ke ilm ki koi baat naql karta ho. Yunus ke sath us hadis ko Aqeel aur Muhammad-bin Waleed Zubaidi aur Ishaq bin Yahya kalbi ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Mamar ne usko Zohri se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke aap ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko ghairullaah ki qism khaatey suna. riwayat mein lafz ( اثارة ( ki tafseer ( اثرا ( ki munaasibat se bayan kar di kyonke donon ka maadda (route) aik hi hai."
"6648","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' apne bap daadon ki qism na khaao .''"
"6649","qabila jurm aur ash'ar ke darmyan bhai chaara tha. ham abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein maujood they, to unke liye khana laya gaya. usmein murghi bhi thi. unke paas bani taimillaah ka aik surkh rang ka aadmi bhi maujood tha. ghaaliban wo ghulaamon mein se tha. abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey khaney par bulaya to usne kaha ke maine murghi ko gandagi khaatey dekha to mujhey ghin aai aur phir maine qism kha li ke ab main iska gosht nahi khaaunga. abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke khadey ho jao to main tumhen iske barey mein aik hadis sunaun . main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas qabila ash'ar ke chand logon ke sath aaya aur ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawari ka janwar maanga . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism main tumhen sawari nahi de sakta aur na mere paas aisa koi janwar hai jo tumhen sawari ke liye de sakoon, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh maale-ghanimat ke oont aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke Ash-ari log kahan hain phir aap ne ham ko panch umda qism ke oont diye janey ka hukm farmaya, jab ham unko lekar chaley to ham ne kaha ye ham ne kya kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) to qism kha chukey they ke ham ko sawari nahi dengey aur dar-haqiqat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas us waqt sawari maujood bhi na thi phir aap ne ham ko sawar kara diya. ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ki qism se ghaafil kar diya. qism Allah ki ham is harkat ke baad kabhi falaah nahi pa sakengey . to ham aap ki taraf lot kar aaey aur aap se ham ne uper wali tafseel ko arz kya ke ham aap ke paas aaey they taake aap ham ko sawari par Sawar kara dein to aap ne qism kha li thi ke aap ham ko sawar nahi karaaeingey aur dar-haqiqat us waqt aap ke paas sawari maujood bhi na thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sab sun kar farmaya ke maine tum ko sawar nahi karaya balke Allah ne tum ko sawar kara diya. Allah ki qism jab main koi qism kha leta hun baad mein us se behtar aur mamla dekhta hun to main wahi karta hun jo behtar hota hai aur us qism ka kaffara ada kar deta hun."
"6650","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne qism khaaii aur kaha ke '' laat w uzzaa ki qism '' to usey phir kalima ( لا إله إلا الله ( keh lena chahiye aur jo shakhs apne sathi se kahey ke aao juwa khelein to usey chahiye ke (iske kaffara mein) sadqa kare."
"6651","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki aik anguthi banwaai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey pahntey they, iska nageena hatheli ke hissey ki taraf rakhtey they. phir logon ne bhi aisi anguthiyan banwaa lein iske baad aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par baithey aur apni anguthi utaar di aur farmaya ke main usey pehnta tha aur iska nageena andar ki taraf rakhta tha, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey utaar kar phenk diya aur farmaya ke Allah ki qism mein ab usey kabhi nahi pahnoonga. to logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan utaar kar phenk din."
"6652","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo Islam ke siwa kisi aur mazhab par qism khaaey to wo aisa hi hai jaise ke usne qism khaaii hai aur jo shakhs apne nafs ko kisi cheez se halaak karey wo dozakh mein usi cheez se azab diya jata rahega aur momin par laanat bhejna usko qatl karne ke barabar hai aur jisne kisi momin par kufr ka ilzam lagaya to wo bhi uske qatl karne ke barabar hai.''"
"6653","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke Bani-Israeel mein teen shakhs they Allah ne unko aazmaanaa chaha ( phir Sara qissa bayan kya ( Farishtey ko kodhii ke paas bheja wo us se kehney laga meri rozii ke sarey zariey kat gaey hain ab Allah hi ka aasraa hai phir tera (ya ab Allah hi ki madad darkaar hai phir teri ( phir poori hadis ko zikr kya."
"6654","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qism khaney waley ko sachcha karne ka hukm farmaayaa."
"6655","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik sahibzadi ( Zenab ( ne aapko bula bheja us waqt aap ke paas Usama-bin-Zaid aur Sad-bin-Ubada aur Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) bhi baithey they. sahibzadi saahiba ne kelha bheja ke unka bachcha marney ke qareeb hai aap tashrif laaiye. aap ne unke jawab mein yun kelha bheja mera salam kaho aur kaho sab Allah ka maal hai jo usney ley liya aur jo usney inayat farmaya aur har cheez ka uske paas waqt muqarrar hai, sabr karo aur Allah se sawab ki ummeed rakho . sahibzadi saahiba ne qism de kar phir kelha bheja ke nahi aap zaroor tashrif laaiye . us waqt aap uthey , ham log bhi sath uthey jab aap sahibzadi saahiba ke ghar par pahunchey aur wahan ja kar baithey to bachchey ko utha kar aap ke paas laey. aap ne usey god mein bitha liya wo dam tod raha tha. ye ranj bhara haal dekh kar aap ki aankhon se aansu bah nikley. Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye ronaa kaisa hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye ronaa raham ki wjah se hai aur Allah apne jis bandey ke dil mein chahta hai raham rakhta hai ya ye hai ke Allah apne un hi bandon par raham karega jo dusron par raham kartey hain."
"6656","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis musalman ke teen bachchey mar jayen to usko dozakh ki aag nahi chhueygii magar sirf qism utaarney ke liye. ''"
"6657","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke main tum ko bataun jannati kon log hain, har aik ghareeb kamzor jo agar Allah ke bharosey par qism kha baithey to Allah usko sachcha karey ( uski qism poori kar de) aur dozakhi kon log hain har aik motaa, ladaakaa, maghroor aur fasaadii."
"6658","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya ke kon log achchhey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mera zamana , phir wo log jo us se qareeb hongey phir wo log jo us se qareeb hongey. iske baad aik aisi qaum paida hogi jiski gawahi qism se pahley zaban par aa jaya karegi aur qism gawahi se pahley . Ibrahim ne kaha ke hamarey asaatza jab ham kam Umr they, to hamein qism khaney se mana kya kartey they ke ham gawahi ya ahad mein qism khaaein ."
"6660","phir Ashas bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) wahan se guzrey aur puchha ke Abdullah tum se kya bayan kar rahe they. ham ne unse bayan kya to Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye aayat mere aur mere aik sathi ke barey mein nazil hui thi, aik kuwein ke silsiley mein ham donon ka jhagdaa tha."
"6661","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jahannam barabar yahi kehti rahegi ke kya kuchh aur hai kya kuchh aur hai? aakhir Allah tabarak w taala apna qadam usmein rakh dega to wo keh uthegi bas bas mein bhar gaee, teri izzat ki qasam! aur iska kuchh hissey kuchh ko khaney lagega.'' us riwayat ko Shoba ne Qatada se naql kya."
"6662","maine Urwa bin Zubair, Saeed-bin-Musaiyab, Alqama bin Waqas aur Ubaidullah bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi siddiiqa (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat ke mutaalliq suna ke jab tohmat lagaaney waley ne un par tohmat lagai thi aur Allah Taala ne unko us se barii qarar diya tha aur har shakhs ne mujh se poori baat ka koi aik hissey hi bayan kaa. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur Abdullah-bin-Ubai ke barey mein madad chaahi. phir Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke Allah ki qasam! (لعمر الله) ham zaroor usey qatl kar dengey ( mufassal hadis peechhey guzar chuki hai)."
"6663","aayat لا يؤاخذكم الله باللغو ''Allaah taala tum se laghw qasmon ke barey mein pakad nahi karega .'' rawi ne bayan kya ke Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye aayat لا ، Mina والله بلى والله‏ ( be-saakhta jo qismein aadat bana li jati hain) ke barey mein nazil hui thi."
"6664","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke Allah Taala ne meri ummat ki un ghaltiyon ko maaf kya hai jinka sirf dil mein waswasa guzrey ya dil mein uske karne ki khahish paida ho, magar iske mutabiq amal na ho aur na baat ki ho."
"6665","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (hijjatul-wadaa mein) qurbani ke din khutba de rahe they ke aik sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah! main falan-falan arkaan ko falan-falan arkaan se pahley khayal karta tha (is ghalati se unko aagey peechhey ada kya ( iske baad doosrey sahib khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main falan-falan arkaan Haj ke mutaalliq yoonhii khayal karta tha unka ishara (halaq, rami aur nahar) ki taraf tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yoonhii kar lo (taqdeem w taakheer karne mein) aaj unmein se kisi kaam mein koi harj nahi hai. chunanche us din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jis mas'ale mein bhi puchha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi farmaya ke kar lo koi harj nahi."
"6666","aik sahabi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha, maine rami karne se pahley tawaaf ziyaarat kar liya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi harj nahi. teesrey ne kaha ke maine rami karne se pahley hi zabah kar liya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya koi harj nahi."
"6667","aik sahabi masjide-Nabawi mein Namaz padhney ke liye aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid ke aik kinarey tashrif rakhtey they. phir wo sahabi aaey aur salam kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ja phir Namaz padh , isliye ke tu ney Namaz nahi padhi. wo wapas gaey aur phir Namaz padh kar aaey aur salam kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us martaba bhi unse yahi farmaya ke wapas ja aur Namaz padh kyonke tu ney Namaz nahi padhi. aakhir teesri martaba mein wo sahabi boley ke phir mujhey Namaz ka tariqa sikhaa dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum Namaz ke liye khadey hua karo to pahley poori tarah wuzu kar liya karo, phir qible ki taraf rukh karkey takbeer kaho aur jo kuchh Quran Majeed main tumhen yad hai aur tum aasani ke sath padh saktey ho usey padha karo, phir rukoo karo aur sukoon ke sath rukoo kar chuko to apna sar uthao aur jab seedhey khadey ho jao to sajda karo, jab sajdey ki haalat main achi tarah ho jao to sajde se sar uthaao, yahan tak ke seedhey ho jao aur itminan se baith jao, phir sajda karo aur jab itminan se sajda kar lo to sar uthao yahan tak ke seedhey khadey ho jao, ye amal tum apni poori Namaz mein karo."
"6668","jab Uhud ki ladai mein mushrik shikast kha gaey aur apni shikast unmein mashhoor ho gaee to iblees ne cheekh kar kaha ( musalmanon se) ke aey Allah ke bando! peechhey dushman hai chunanche aagey ke log peechhey ki taraf pil padey aur peechhey waley (musalmanon hi se) lad padey. is haalat mein Huzaifa-bin-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha ke log unke musalman walid ko be-khabri mein mar rahe hain to unhon-ne musalmanon se kaha ke ye to mere walid hain jo musalman hain, mere walid ! Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Allah ki qism log phir bhi baaz nahi aaey aur aakhir unhein qatl kar hi dala. Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Allah tumhari maghfirat kare. Urwa ne bayan kya ke Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ko apne walid ki is tarah shahadat ka aakhir waqt tak ranj aur afsos hi raha yahan tak ke wo Allah se ja miley."
"6669","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne roza rakha ho aur bhool kar kha liya ho to usey apna roza pura kar lena chahiye kyonke usey Allah ne khilaaya pilaya hai.''"
"6670","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Namaz padhai aur pehli 2 rakaat ke baad baithney se pahley hi uth gaey aur Namaz poori kar li. jab Namaz padh chukey to logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke salam ka intizar kya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne takbeer kahi aur salam pherney se pahley sajda kya, phir sajde se sar uthaya aur dobara takbeer keh kar sajda kya. phir sajde se sar uthaya aur salam phera ."
"6671","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein Zohar ki Namaz padhai aur Namaz mein koi cheez zyada ya kam kar di. Mansoor ne bayan kya ke mujhey malum nahi Ibrahim ko shuba hua tha ya Alqama ko. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya ke ya Rasulullah! Namaz mein kuchh kami kar di gaee hai ya aap bhool gaey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kya baat hai? logon ne kaha ke aap ne is-is tarah Namaz padhai hai. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sath 2 sajdey (saho ke) kiye aur farmaya ye 2 sajdey us shakhs ke liye hain jisey yaqin na ho ke usne apni Namaz mein kami ya zyada kar di hai usey chahiye ke sahi baat tak pahunchne ke liye zahan par zor daley aur jo baqi reh gaya ho usey pura karey phir 2 sajdey ( saho ke) kar ley."
"6672","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aayat لا تؤاخذني بما نسيت wla ترهقني من أمري عسرا‏ ke mutaalliq ke pehli martaba aetraz Musa (Alaihissalam) se bhool kar hua tha."
"6673","unke yahan kuchh unke mehman thahrey huey they, to unhon-ne apne ghar walon se kaha ke unke wapas aaney se pahley janwar zabah kar lein taake unke mehman khaaein, chunanche unhon-ne Namaz eidul-Azha se pahley janwar zabah kar liya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke Namaz ke baad dobara zabah karein. Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! mere paas aik saal se zyada doodh wali bakri hai jo 2 bakriyon ke gosht se badh kar hai. ibne- Auf Shabi ki hadis ke us maqam par thahar jatey they aur Muhammad-bin Sirin se usi hadis ki tarah hadis bayan kartey they aur us maqam par ruk kar kehtey they ke mujhey malum nahi, ye rukhsat doosrey logon ke liye bhi hai ya sirf Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye hi thi. uski riwayat Ayub ne Ibne-Sirin se ki hai, unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6674","main us waqt tak maujood tha jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne eid ki Namaz padhai phir khutba diya aur farmaya ke jisne Namaz se pahley zabah kar liya ho usey chahiye ke uski jagah doosra janwar zabah karey aur jisne abhi zabah na kya ho usey chahiye ke Allah ka naam lekar janwar zabah kare."
"6675","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kabeera gunah Allah ke sath shirk karnaa, waalidain ki nafarmani karnaa, kisi ki nahaq jaan lena aur) يمين الغموس‏) qasdan jhooti qism khaney ko kehtey hain."
"6677","Abdullah ye hadis bayan kar chukey they, itney mein Ashas bin Qais aaey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ne tum logon se kya hadis bayan ki hai? logon ne kaha is-is mazmoon ki. unhon-ne kaha ajii ye aayat to mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi mere aik chacha-zad bhai ki zameen mein mera aik kunwaan tha iske jhagdey ke silsile mein main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna muddua-alaih se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! phir wo to jhooti qism kha lega. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne jhooti qism bd-niyati ke sath isliye khaaii ke iske zariey kisi musalman ka maal hadap kar jaey to qiyamat ke din Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo Allah is par intihai ghazabnaak hoga."
"6678","mere sathiyon ne mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein sawari ke janwar maangney ke liye bheja to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism main tumharey liye koi sawari ka janwar nahi de sakta (kyonke maujood nahi hain) jab main aap ke samney aaya to aap kuchh narazgi mein they. phir jab dobara aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne sathiyon ke paas ja aur keh ke Allah Taala ne ya (ye kaha ke) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumharey liye sawari ka intizam kar diya."
"6679","maine Urwa-bin-Zubair , Saeed bin Musaiyab , Alqama bin Waqas aur Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) par bohtan ki baat ke mutaalliq , jab un par tohmat lagaaney walon ne tohmat lagai thi aur Allah Taala ne unko us tohmat se barii qarar diya tha, un sab logon ne mujh se us qissa ka koi aik tukda bayan kya (is hadis mein ye bhi hai ke) phir Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki) إن الذين جاءوا بالإفك‏ (ke '' bila shubah jin logon ne jhooti tohmat lagai hai'' das aayaton tak. jo sab ki sab meri paakii bayan karne ke liye nazil hui thin Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) , mistah (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath qaraabat ki wjah se unka kharch apne zimme liye huey they, kaha ke Allah ki qism ab kabhi mistah par koi cheez aik paisa kharch nahi karunga. iske baad ke usne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) par is tarah ki jhooti tohmat lagai hai. is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki) wla يأتل أولو al-Fazal منكم والسعة أن يؤتوا أولي القربى‏ ( الخ Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha, kyon nahi, Allah ki qism main to yahi pasand karta hun ke Allah meri maghfirat kar de. chunanche unhon-ne phir mistah ko wo kharch dena shuru kar diya jo us se pahley unhein diya kartey they aur kaha ke Allah ki qism mein ab kharch dene ko kabhi nahi rokoonga."
"6680","mein qabila ash'ar ke chand sathiyon ke sath Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua jab main aap ke paas aaya to aap ghussa they phir ham ne aap se sawari ka janwar maanga to aap ne qism kha li ke aap hamarey liye iska intizam nahi kar saktey. iske baad farmaya : Allah ki qism , Allah ne chaha to main kabhi bhi agar koi qism kha loonga aur uske siwa dusri cheez mein bhalai dekhoonga to wahi karunga jis mein bhalai hogi aur qism tod doonga."
"6681","jab janab abu-Taalib ki maut ka waqt qareeb hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas aaey aur kaha ke aap keh dijiye ke '' la ilaaha-illallaah '' to main aap ke liye Allah se jhagad sakunga ."
"6682","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' 2 kalimey jo zaban par halkey hain lekin taraazu par) aakhirat mein) bhari hain aur Allah Rehman ke yahan pasandida hain wo ye hain سبحان الله وبحمده ، Mina سبحان الله العظيم‏ ."
"6683","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aur maine (isii par guman kartey huey) doosra kalima kaha (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) jo shakhs is haal mein mar jaeyga ke Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thahraataa hoga to wo jahannam mein jaaeyga.'' aur maine dusri baat kahi ke jo shakhs is haal mein mar jaeyga ke Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik na thahraataa hoga wo jannat mein jaeyga"
"6684","aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paon mein moch aa gaee thi. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaane mein untees din tak thahre huey rahe phir wahan se utrey, logon ne kaha ya Rasulullah! aap ne iilaa aik mahiney ke liye kya tha? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye mahina untees din ka hai."
"6685","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne nikah kya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apni shadi ke mauqe par bulaya. dulhan hi unki mezbaanii ka kaam kar rahi thin, phir Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne logon se poochha, tumhen malum hai, maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kya pilaya tha. kaha ke raat main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye maine khajoor aik badey piyaale mein bhigo di thi aur subah ke waqt uska pani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pilaya tha."
"6686","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi saahiba Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke unki aik bakri mar gaee to uske chamdey ko ham ne dabaaghat de diya. phir ham uski mashk mein nabeez banatey rahe yahan tak ke wo puraanii ho gaee."
"6687","aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kabhi pai-dar-pai teen din tak saalan ke sath gehun ki roti nahi kha sakey yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ja miley aur ibne-kaseer ne bayan kya ke ham ko Sufiyan ne khabar di ke ham se Abdur-Rehman ne bayan kya, unse unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"6688","abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne (apni biwi ( Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke main sun kar aa raha hun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki awaz (faaqon ki wjah se) kamzor pad gaee hai aur maine awaz se aap ke faaqe ka andaza lagaya hai. kya tumharey paas khaney ki koi cheez hai? unhon-ne kaha haan. chunanche unhon-ne jau ki chand rotiyaan nikaaliin aur aik odhnii lekar roti ko uske aik koney se lapet diya aur usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhijwaayaa . main lekar gaya to maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein tashrif rakhtey hain aur aap ke sath kuchh log hain, main unke paas ja ke khada ho gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne poochha, kya tumhen abu-Talha ne bheja hai, maine arz kya : ji haan. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un logon se kaha jo sath they ke utho aur chalo, main unke aagey-aagey chal raha tha. aakhir mein abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan pahuncha aur unko itlaa di. abu-Talha ne kaha : Umme-Sulaim! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey hain aur hamarey paas to koi aisa khana nahi hai jo sab ko pesh kya ja sakey? unhon-ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. phir abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) bahar nikley aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se miley, iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur abu-Talha ghar ki taraf badhey aur andar gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Umme-Sulaim! jo kuchh tumharey paas hai mere paas laao. wo yahi rotiyaan laaein. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se un rotiyon ko chooraa kar diya gaya aur Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni aik ( ghi ki) kapii ko nichodaa gaya yahi saalan tha. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jaisa ke Allah ne chaha dua padhi aur farmaya ke das das aadmiyon ko andar bulao unhein bulaya gaya aur is tarah sab logon ne khaya aur khub sair ho gaey, haaziriin ki tadaad 70 ya usi aadmiyon ki thi."
"6689","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke bila shubah amal ka daro-madar niyat par hai aur insan ko wahi milega jiski wo niyat karega to jiski hijrat Allah aur uske rasool ke liye hogi to waqei wo unhiin ke liye hogi aur jiski hijrat duniya hasil karne ke liye ya kisi aurat se shadi karne ke liye hogi to uski hijrat usi ke liye hogi jiske liye us ne hijrat ki."
"6690","jab Kab (Raziallahu anhu) naa-beenaa ho gaey they, to unki aulad mein aik yahi kahin aaney janey mein unke sath rahtey they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se unke waaqie aur aayat على الثلاثة الذين خلفوا ke silsile mein suna, unhon-ne apni hadis ke aakhir mein kaha ke (maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney ye pesh kash! ki ke) apni tauba ki khushi mein main apna maal Allah aur uske rasool ke Deen ki khidmat mein sadqa kar dun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke apna kuchh maal apne paas hi rakho, ye tumharey liye behtar hai."
"6691","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ummul-momeneen) Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan rukte they aur shehad peetey they. phir maine aur (ummul-momeneen) Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne ahad kya ke ham mein se jiske paas bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aaein to wo kahey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh se maghaafeer ki bu aati hai, aap ne maghaafeer to nahi khaaii hai? chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab aik ke yahan tashrif laey to unhon-ne yahi baat aap se poochhii. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke maine shehad piyaa hai Zenab binte-Jahash ke yahan aur ab kabhi nahi piyunga. (kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko yaqin ho gaya ke waqei usmein maghaafeer ki bu aati hai) is par ye aayat nazil hui (ya أيها النبي لم تحرم ما أحل الله لك ( ''aey Nabi ! aap aisi cheez kyon haram kartey hain jo Allah ne aap ke liye halal ki hai.'' ( إن تتوبا إلى الله ( main Aaisha aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf ishara hai aur وإذ أسر النبي إلى بعض أزواجه حديثا se ishara Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ki taraf hai ke '' nahi '' maine shehad piyaa hai.'' aur mujh se Ibrahim bin-Musa ne Hisham se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke ab kabhi mein shehad nahi piyunga maine qism kha li hai tum uski kisi ko khabar na karna (phir aap ne us qism ko tod diyaa) ."
"6692","unhon-ne kaha, kya logon ko nazar se mana nahi kya gaya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nazar kisi cheez ko na aagey kar sakti hai na peechhey , albatta iske zariey kanjoos ka maal nikala ja sakta hai."
"6693","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nazar se mana farmaya tha aur farmaya tha ke wo kisi cheez ko wapas nahi kar saktii, albatta iske zariey kanjoos ka maal nikala ja sakta hai."
"6694","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' nazar insan ko koi aisi cheez nahi deti jo iske muqaddar mein na ho, albatta Allah Taala iske zariey kanjoos se uska maal nikalwaataa hai aur is tarah wo cheezein sadqa kar deta hai jiski us se pahley uski ummeed nahi ki ja sakti thii.''"
"6695","maine Imran-bin-Husain se suna, wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kartey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein sabse behtar mera zamana hai, iske baad unka jo iske qareeb hongey. iske baad wo jo us se qareeb hongey.'' Imran ne bayan kya ke mujhey yad nahi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne zamane ke baad 2 ka zikr kya tha ya teen ka ( farmaya ke) phir aik aisi qaum aaeygii jo nazar maanegii aur usey pura nahi karegi , khayanat karegi aur un par aitimad nahi rahega. wo gawahi dene ke liye taiyaar rahengey jabke unse gawahi ke liye kaha bhi nahi jaeyga aur unmein mutaapaa aam ho jaeyga"
"6696","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne iski nazar maana ho ke Allah ki itaat karega to usey itaat karni chahiye lekin jisne Allah ki gunah (naafarmaanii) ki nazar maana ho usey na karni chaahiye.''"
"6697","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! maine jahiliyat mein nazar maana thi ke masjide-Haraam mein aik raat ka aetikaf karunga ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apni nazar poori kar."
"6698","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik nazar ke barey mein puchha jo unki walida ke zimma baqi thi aur unki maut nazar poori karne se pahley ho gaee thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein fatwa diya ke nazar wo apni maa ki taraf se poori kar dein. chunanche baad mein yahi tariqa masnoona qarar paya."
"6699","aik sahib Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey aur arz kya ke meri behan ne nazar maana thi ke Haj karengii lekin ab unka intiqal ho chuka hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar un par koi qarz hota to kya tum usey ada kartey ? unhon-ne kaha zaroor ada kartey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Allah ka qarz bhi ada karo kyonke wo iska zyada mustahiq hai ke iska qarz pura ada kya jaey."
"6700","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne Allah ki itaat ki nazar maana ho usey chahiye ke itaat karey aur jisne gunah karne ki nazar maana ho to wo gunah na kare. ''"
"6701","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala us se be-parwaa hai ke ye shakhs apni jaan ko azab mein daaley.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekha ke wo apne 2 beton ke darmyan chal raha tha aur fazari ne bayan kya, unse Humaid ne, unse Sabit ne bayan kya aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"6702","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko dekha ke wo Kaba ka tawaaf lagaam ya iske siwa kisi aur cheez ke zariey kar raha tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey kaat diya."
"6703","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guzrey to Kaba ka aik shakhs is tarah tawaaf kar raha tha ke doosra shakhs uski naak mein rassii baandh kar uske aagey se uski rehnumai kar raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo rassii apne hath se kaat di, phir hukm diya ke hath se uski rehnumai kare."
"6704","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba de rahe they ke aik shakhs ko khadey dekha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske mutaalliq puchha to logon ne bataya ke ye abu-Israaeel naam ke hain. unhon-ne nazar maana hai ke khadey hi rahengey, baithengey nahi, na kisi cheez ke saaye mein baithengey aur na kisi se baat karengey aur roza rakhengey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unse kaho ke baat karein, saaye ke nichey baithein uthein aur apna roza pura kar lein. abdul-wahaab ne bayan kya ke ham se Ayub ne bayan kya, unse Ikrima ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6705","unse aisey shakhs ke mutaalliq puchha gaya jisne nazar maana ho ke kuchh makhsoos dinon mein rozey rakhega . phir ittifaq se unhiin dinon mein Baaqar eid ya eid ke din pad gaey hon? Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi behtreen namoona hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Baaqar eid aur eid ke din rozey nahi rakhtey they aur na un dinon mein rozey ko jaaiz samajhtey they."
"6706","mein ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath tha aik shakhs ne unse puchha ke maine nazar maana hai ke har mangal ya buddh ke din roza rakhoonga. ittifaq se isi din ki Baaqar eid pad gaee hai? ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne nazar poori karne ka hukm diya hai aur hamein Baaqar eid ke din roza rakhney ki manaahii ki gaee hai. us shakhs ne dobara apna sawal dohraya to aap ne phir us se sirf itni hi baat kahi is par koi zyadti nahi ki."
"6707","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar ki ladai ke liye nikley. us ladai mein hamein sona , chandi ghaneemat mein nahi mila tha balke doosrey amwaal , kapdey aur saman mila tha. phir bani Khubaib ke aik shakhs Rifaa bin Zaid naam ke ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik ghulam hadiye mein diya ghulam ka naam mud'am tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wadi Quraa ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur jab aap wadi ul-Quraa mein pahunch gaey to mud'am ko jabke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka kajaawa durust kar raha tha. aik anjaan teer aa kar laga aur uski maut ho gaee. logon ne kaha ke jannat usey Mubarak ho, lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hargiz nahi, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai wo kambal jo usney taqseem se pahley khaibar ke maale-ghanimat mein se churaa liya tha, wo is par aag ka angaara bin kar bhid raha hai. jab logon ne ye baat suni to aik shakhs chappal ka tasma ya 2 tasmey lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye aag ka tasma hai ya 2 tasmey aag ke hain."